[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9611.349, "timestamp": "02:40:11", "text": "開放了。他們人真的很好，也很有趣。如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9613.75, "timestamp": "02:40:13", "text": "今天喜歡他們的陪伴，歡迎"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9614.754, "timestamp": "02:40:14", "author": "@YoshinoForger", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8gvoFZRCC3O1WtnuXJ-8nNaJku7JJTjtn6w5sm-PHzI80a-qpWom6sTXzcrDXoKhi0Ggs3FkOg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "otsu joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9620.87, "timestamp": "02:40:20", "text": "追蹤並訂閱他們。  所以，嗯，你好。  你好。是的。  所以，在結束之前，我只想再說一件事。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9623.19, "timestamp": "02:40:23", "text": "我知道這更像是一次重新開始。我得從頭開始重建一切。不過沒關係"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9629.979, "timestamp": "02:40:29", "author": "@YoshinoForger", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8gvoFZRCC3O1WtnuXJ-8nNaJku7JJTjtn6w5sm-PHzI80a-qpWom6sTXzcrDXoKhi0Ggs3FkOg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oyasumiiii"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9629.99, "timestamp": "02:40:29", "text": "。我現在想做自己想做的事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9632.23, "timestamp": "02:40:32", "text": "而不是跟隨潮流，因為這兩年對我來說很重要。我已經直播了大概"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9635.152, "timestamp": "02:40:35", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bye bye oskare"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9640.87, "timestamp": "02:40:40", "text": "六年了，感覺自己把時間都浪費在直播上了，沒有學習任何技能，像是隨機玩遊戲之類的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9642.133, "timestamp": "02:40:42", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "good night"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9656.115, "timestamp": "02:40:56", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/PVfsZ-7tIYCO_9EPt-GMgAwUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/PVfsZ-7tIYCO_9EPt-GMgAw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9659.59, "timestamp": "02:40:59", "text": "。所以現在我減少了直播遊戲的優先順序。我們可以每週做一次，或只與其他 YouTuber 合作。是的。但我確實想工作，並更加專注於技能的創造性方面，例如音樂製作或日語"}]